WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 8=

22
01:57.865 --> 01:59.104
I applied for that job

23
01:59.544 --> 02:01.505
because you broke your promise.

24
02:09.064 --> 02:10.105
I'm human too.

25
02:10.744 --> 02:11.705
I would also get tired.

26
02:12.105 --> 02:12.624
Here,

27
02:13.105 --> 02:14.105
I have to handle

28
02:14.184 --> 02:14.985
everything alone.

29
02:15.064 --> 02:16.425
I'm doing everything I can

30
02:16.545 --> 02:17.705
to pave the way for us.

31
02:17.865 --> 02:18.664
If things go off,

32
02:19.344 --> 02:20.865
no one can help or save me.

33
02:22.825 --> 02:24.385
I'm already struggling.

34
02:26.265 --> 02:27.624
Instead of helping me,

35
02:28.385 --> 02:29.744
you're now getting in my way.

36
02:30.184 --> 02:31.105
Why?

37
02:31.344 --> 02:32.504
Can you tell me

38
02:33.705 --> 02:34.664
why you insisted

39
02:35.025 --> 02:36.105
on staying

40
02:36.985 --> 02:38.105
without taking my advice?

41
02:40.425 --> 02:41.545
I'm afraid you will stay.

42
02:44.184 --> 02:45.464
And I feel bad for her.

43
02:46.425 --> 02:47.664
You stay to take care of her

44
02:48.904 --> 02:50.105
out of guilt?

45
02:54.545 --> 02:55.664
You pity her,

46
02:56.504 --> 02:56.944
but

47
02:56.944 --> 02:58.184
when she turns against us,

48
02:58.464 --> 02:59.825
who's going to pity us?

49
03:00.585 --> 03:01.265
If she finds out

50
03:01.305 --> 03:02.345
how much money I gave you,

51
03:02.904 --> 03:03.825
will she let you off

52
03:03.985 --> 03:05.064
out of pity?

53
03:05.705 --> 03:06.705
Will she let us off

54
03:06.865 --> 03:07.664
out of pity?

55
03:09.425 --> 03:09.904
No.

56
03:11.385 --> 03:11.784
Exactly.

57
03:12.385 --> 03:13.265
She won't.

58
03:14.825 --> 03:16.585
You have all our money.

59
03:18.184 --> 03:19.344
For our future,

60
03:20.105 --> 03:21.585
you have to keep the faith.

61
03:27.985 --> 03:29.184
(What's your plan now?)

62
03:29.184 --> 03:30.310
(Wen Xiaoxiao)

63
03:31.944 --> 03:32.865
Win over Zhang Yu.

64
03:34.385 --> 03:36.025
(The Product Center's top priority)

65
03:36.224 --> 03:37.224
(is the Jinghua line.)

66
03:37.825 --> 03:38.545
(Zhang Yu devotes)

67
03:38.585 --> 03:39.585
(herself to it.)

68
03:39.985 --> 03:41.425
(During the development of Jinghua,)

69
03:41.705 --> 03:43.585
(from staff bonuses)

70
03:44.025 --> 03:45.705
(to executive promotions)

71
03:46.224 --> 03:47.744
(and shareholder dividends,)

72
03:48.064 --> 03:48.904
(everything rides on)

73
03:48.904 --> 03:49.944
(the launch.)

74
03:50.545 --> 03:52.105
(Joining the Product Center)

75
03:52.344 --> 03:53.585
(at a critical time like this)

76
03:54.784 --> 03:55.265
(is tough.)

77
03:58.545 --> 03:59.344
Is that so?

78
04:00.664 --> 04:01.624
Then tell me,

79
04:01.784 --> 04:03.064
what kind of person is Zhang Yu?

80
04:03.385 --> 04:04.344
Give me a heads-up.

81
04:05.064 --> 04:05.744
(Her?)

82
04:06.224 --> 04:06.985
(She's not human,)

83
04:07.425 --> 04:09.184
(but a ruthless workaholic.)

84
04:09.504 --> 04:10.624
(She's tough on others,)

85
04:10.744 --> 04:11.744
(and tougher on herself.)

86
04:11.944 --> 04:13.825
(Computers shut down when they overheat,)

87
04:14.184 --> 04:16.265
(but Zhang Yu never rests.)

88
04:21.265 --> 04:21.904
Ms. Zhang,

89
04:22.505 --> 04:23.065
got a minute?

90
04:24.185 --> 04:24.984
Meng,

91
04:25.505 --> 04:26.104
what is it?

92
04:26.505 --> 04:27.625
I want in on Product Center

93
04:27.945 --> 04:29.505
and learn from Jinghua

94
04:29.784 --> 04:30.585
and the crew.

95
04:31.424 --> 04:32.705
You're not suited for this job.

96
04:33.625 --> 04:34.784
Without even an interview,

97
04:35.224 --> 04:36.265
you're rejecting me?

98
04:37.224 --> 04:38.265
Please introduce yourself.

99
04:40.145 --> 04:40.825
I'm Yu Meng.

100
04:40.984 --> 04:41.904
I'm 32 years old,

101
04:42.104 --> 04:43.625
graduated from Jiangzhou University.

102
04:43.625 --> 04:44.585
I worked at Jiali

103
04:44.625 --> 04:45.864
for six months,

104
04:45.984 --> 04:47.344
and I'm a content creator.

105
04:47.585 --> 04:48.224
Well,

106
04:48.705 --> 04:49.664
your resume shows

107
04:49.664 --> 04:50.385
no work experience

108
04:50.385 --> 04:51.625
for the past four years.

109
04:52.464 --> 04:52.945
Correct.

110
04:53.224 --> 04:54.505
Back then,

111
04:54.664 --> 04:55.825
I had different life plans.

112
04:56.424 --> 04:57.344
Didn't you consider

113
04:57.424 --> 04:58.784
the impact a career gap

114
04:58.825 --> 04:59.304
would have?

115
05:00.585 --> 05:01.664
The logic of work

116
05:01.784 --> 05:02.825
is always the same.

117
05:03.224 --> 05:04.745
I can jump back in anytime.

118
05:08.864 --> 05:09.864
Four years change a lot.

119
05:10.104 --> 05:10.904
Can you handle

120
05:10.945 --> 05:12.065
the workload nowadays?

121
05:13.745 --> 05:14.424
Of course, I can.

122
05:15.065 --> 05:16.265
The account I run

123
05:16.265 --> 05:17.224
has a million followers,

124
05:17.794 --> 05:19.002
an 8 percent conversion rate,

125
05:19.002 --> 05:20.344
and a 60 percent retention rate.

126
05:20.344 --> 05:21.585
If you know

127
05:21.664 --> 05:22.585
even a little

128
05:22.585 --> 05:23.585
about content creators,

129
05:23.585 --> 05:24.224
you'd know

130
05:24.625 --> 05:25.945
it's a job far more grueling

131
05:26.065 --> 05:27.145
than standard overtime.

132
05:29.385 --> 05:30.104
No more questions.

133
05:31.664 --> 05:32.825
When can I start my work?

134
05:34.424 --> 05:35.825
I think you're capable,

135
05:37.065 --> 05:39.945
but Ms. Gao Shan's department

136
05:40.065 --> 05:40.945
would suit you more.

137
05:41.505 --> 05:41.745
But...

138
05:42.145 --> 05:43.784
But I want to join the Product Center.

139
05:43.984 --> 05:45.505
Brand marketing

140
05:45.544 --> 05:46.185
suits

141
05:46.224 --> 05:47.385
your content experience more.

142
05:49.185 --> 05:50.519
Why did you stand me up today?

143
05:50.625 --> 05:52.025
I waited on the roof for so long.

144
05:53.065 --> 05:53.464
Thanks.

145
05:54.424 --> 05:55.424
Sorry.

146
05:55.705 --> 05:57.224
My boss dragged me into a task,

147
05:57.904 --> 05:58.984
and in the rush,

148
05:59.185 --> 06:00.485
I forgot my phone at my desk.

149
06:01.825 --> 06:03.945
All the tasks he assigns me are

150
06:04.185 --> 06:04.864
tedious,

151
06:04.864 --> 06:05.825
mindless

152
06:05.825 --> 06:07.344
chores.

153
06:08.544 --> 06:09.664
It makes me want to quit.

154
06:10.224 --> 06:11.544
You believe your boss

155
06:11.745 --> 06:12.464
has nothing

156
06:12.464 --> 06:13.224
to assign you?

157
06:14.385 --> 06:15.385
I mean those tasks

158
06:15.505 --> 06:16.505
showcasing your skills.

159
06:17.304 --> 06:18.625
Given Di Liren's style,

160
06:19.185 --> 06:20.304
since he's chosen

161
06:20.304 --> 06:21.145
not to see you,

162
06:21.625 --> 06:22.825
that means

163
06:23.025 --> 06:23.625
he won't

164
06:23.664 --> 06:24.784
keep you at Jiali anymore.

165
06:26.025 --> 06:26.864
If it were you,

166
06:27.424 --> 06:28.185
what would you do?

167
06:29.745 --> 06:30.505
Sidelining me.

168
06:32.664 --> 06:33.224
Does

169
06:33.344 --> 06:34.385
the offer you promised

170
06:34.544 --> 06:35.224
still work?

171
06:36.385 --> 06:36.945
Of course.

172
06:37.505 --> 06:38.185
I'm not him.

173
06:38.664 --> 06:39.864
I keep my word.

174
06:40.825 --> 06:41.904
That's a relief.

175
06:42.664 --> 06:43.984
But I haven't watched the ending

176
06:44.145 --> 06:45.305
of the drama between you two.

177
06:46.705 --> 06:47.344
True.

178
06:48.304 --> 06:49.185
Everyone loves

179
06:49.544 --> 06:50.304
a revenge drama,

180
06:50.745 --> 06:51.544
myself included.

181
06:52.065 --> 06:52.825
If you're the lead

182
06:52.984 --> 06:54.104
in this drama,

183
06:54.344 --> 06:55.984
I'll not only subscribe,

184
06:56.344 --> 06:57.664
but also pay for early access

185
06:57.864 --> 06:58.664
to the ending.

186
07:00.864 --> 07:01.904
I actually think

187
07:02.318 --> 07:03.628
it's more like a suspense drama.

188
07:03.705 --> 07:04.864
A new character every day.

189
07:05.185 --> 07:06.185
A new clue every day.

190
07:06.625 --> 07:08.664
I'm hunting for new evidence for the divorce

191
07:09.025 --> 07:10.025
every single moment.

192
07:10.904 --> 07:11.664
It's exhausting.

193
07:12.904 --> 07:13.745
I thought

194
07:13.864 --> 07:14.904
I was a fat part,

195
07:15.585 --> 07:16.286
but it turns out

196
07:16.745 --> 07:18.984
I'm just a clue leading to

197
07:19.625 --> 07:20.185
the tough one.

198
07:29.265 --> 07:29.984
Delivery for you.

199
07:32.304 --> 07:32.784
Thank you.

200
07:52.904 --> 07:53.705
From Di Liren.

201
08:00.224 --> 08:01.025
(I saw this lamp)

202
08:01.025 --> 08:01.984
(on your wishlist.)

203
08:01.984 --> 08:02.784
(Got it for you.)

204
08:03.224 --> 08:03.864
(Use it.)

205
08:04.424 --> 08:05.745
(I'll drop by to check.)

206
08:09.784 --> 08:10.784
That's an imported brand

207
08:10.784 --> 08:12.104
I've been eyeing.

208
08:13.065 --> 08:14.025
I'll return it.

209
08:15.745 --> 08:16.185
Never mind.

210
08:16.544 --> 08:17.745
If you return it,

211
08:18.104 --> 08:19.185
he'll get suspicious.

212
08:46.745 --> 08:47.904
Meng, slow down.

213
08:49.424 --> 08:50.265
You don't have to.

214
08:51.664 --> 08:53.025
I insist, Ms. Hui.

215
08:53.865 --> 08:54.664
Over the past year,

216
08:54.745 --> 08:55.385
you took care

217
08:55.385 --> 08:56.145
of my parents well.

218
08:56.904 --> 08:58.505
And when my dad had a brain hemorrhage,

219
08:58.505 --> 08:59.105
you sent him

220
08:59.184 --> 09:00.345
to the hospital in time.

221
09:00.704 --> 09:02.105
My whole family is grateful to you.

222
09:03.064 --> 09:04.505
I did what I should.

223
09:06.664 --> 09:07.784
Ms. Hui,

224
09:08.025 --> 09:08.664
considering

225
09:08.664 --> 09:10.025
how sincere I am,

226
09:10.824 --> 09:12.625
please don't refuse, okay?

227
09:16.544 --> 09:16.985
Ms. Hui,

228
09:17.465 --> 09:18.505
I've never seen you

229
09:18.584 --> 09:19.465
wear this before.

230
09:19.704 --> 09:20.265
So pretty.

231
09:21.424 --> 09:22.225
I just bought it.

232
09:22.865 --> 09:24.304
I've been working so hard,

233
09:24.904 --> 09:25.985
so I want to treat myself.

234
09:27.184 --> 09:28.225
Good for you, Ms. Hui.

235
09:28.745 --> 09:29.784
You finally get it.

236
09:30.265 --> 09:31.345
If you idle your money,

237
09:31.385 --> 09:32.544
then someone will spend it.

238
09:32.904 --> 09:33.268
Oh, yeah.

239
09:33.865 --> 09:34.584
Did you know that?

240
09:35.064 --> 09:35.865
Liren

241
09:36.184 --> 09:37.544
worked in a store like this

242
09:37.824 --> 09:38.944
as a salesman before.

243
09:39.145 --> 09:40.664
But that was in Xiaocheng.

244
09:42.784 --> 09:43.424
Really?

245
09:45.824 --> 09:46.745
Ms. Hui, look around.

246
09:47.105 --> 09:48.025
Tell me what you fancy.

247
09:52.584 --> 09:53.385
Check out the bags.

248
09:55.225 --> 09:55.625
Ms. Hui,

249
09:56.105 --> 09:57.105
see which one you like.

250
09:57.865 --> 09:59.465
This isn't my style.

251
09:59.465 --> 10:00.304
It's too expensive.

252
10:00.625 --> 10:01.304
I think this one

253
10:01.304 --> 10:02.184
looks pretty nice.

254
10:02.904 --> 10:03.345
Excuse me,

255
10:03.704 --> 10:04.704
can I see this bag?

256
10:05.184 --> 10:05.664
Sure.

257
10:08.784 --> 10:09.424
Are you...

258
10:09.424 --> 10:10.064
No.

259
10:10.784 --> 10:11.625
Yes, you are.

260
10:13.304 --> 10:13.824
Ms. Hui.

261
10:14.345 --> 10:14.904
It's me.

262
10:15.345 --> 10:16.488
Huang.

263
10:16.488 --> 10:17.664
You've got the wrong person.

264
10:17.784 --> 10:18.904
What a coincidence.

265
10:19.225 --> 10:20.105
You know each other?

266
10:20.625 --> 10:22.025
Sure, she's Ms. Hui.

267
10:22.265 --> 10:22.784
No.

268
10:23.345 --> 10:24.345
I'll go to the restroom.

269
10:26.424 --> 10:27.064
Ms. Hui?

270
10:35.064 --> 10:35.704
(It's working.)

271
10:35.704 --> 10:37.340
(Jiao Xu)

272
10:39.265 --> 10:40.664
Huang recognizes me.

273
10:42.025 --> 10:43.225
I know Huang.

274
10:43.664 --> 10:44.505
He must have noticed

275
10:44.625 --> 10:45.385
you hated to admit.

276
10:45.745 --> 10:47.025
So he told Yu Meng

277
10:47.025 --> 10:47.745
he made a mistake.

278
10:47.944 --> 10:48.904
In that case,

279
10:49.265 --> 10:50.265
it should be fine.

280
10:51.025 --> 10:51.544
What if...

281
10:55.105 --> 10:55.625
Meng.

282
10:55.784 --> 10:56.225
Ms. Hui?

283
10:57.265 --> 10:58.105
Why are you here?

284
10:59.304 --> 10:59.704
I...

285
11:00.560 --> 11:01.520
I wanted to take a bath,

286
11:01.824 --> 11:03.064
but the faucet was acting up.

287
11:03.345 --> 11:04.704
So I asked her to fix it.

288
11:07.064 --> 11:08.025
Isn't it working fine?

289
11:08.664 --> 11:09.385
She just fixed it.

290
11:09.544 --> 11:10.225
That's great.

291
11:10.465 --> 11:12.064
I want to take a bath too.

292
11:12.745 --> 11:14.025
Honey.

293
11:14.544 --> 11:15.904
You take a bath first?

294
11:16.064 --> 11:17.345
I'll massage your shoulders.

295
11:18.465 --> 11:18.944
Good.

296
11:19.385 --> 11:20.184
You haven't

297
11:20.265 --> 11:21.184
massaged me for ages.

298
11:22.505 --> 11:22.904
Come on.

299
11:23.584 --> 11:24.225
Be careful.

300
11:24.345 --> 11:24.985
Take it slow.

301
11:27.824 --> 11:28.304
Ms. Hui,

302
11:28.784 --> 11:29.584
give me the stuff.

303
11:29.865 --> 11:30.664
You may go.

304
11:31.745 --> 11:32.184
Thank you.

305
11:41.465 --> 11:41.985
Ms. Hui,

306
11:42.584 --> 11:43.265
could you please

307
11:43.865 --> 11:45.025
close the door?

308
12:01.424 --> 12:02.304
Honey,

309
12:02.824 --> 12:03.824
what are you waiting for?

310
12:04.424 --> 12:04.784
Come on.

311
12:24.225 --> 12:24.664
Honey.

312
12:24.985 --> 12:25.625
I remembered

313
12:25.664 --> 12:27.025
I have an email to send.

314
12:27.385 --> 12:27.865
I...

315
12:28.184 --> 12:29.385
I can't join you tonight.

316
12:29.505 --> 12:30.225
You go ahead.

317
12:30.904 --> 12:32.025
I have to work.

318
12:43.345 --> 12:43.985
Give me

319
12:43.985 --> 12:45.064
everything on the list.

320
12:45.385 --> 12:46.625
I'm staying overnight.

321
12:47.225 --> 12:48.105
Right away.

322
13:02.505 --> 13:03.304
You are back.

323
13:05.064 --> 13:05.544
Ms. Hui,

324
13:06.584 --> 13:07.465
where did you go?

325
13:09.584 --> 13:10.470
I went to take a bath.

326
13:11.824 --> 13:12.704
You took a bath too?

327
13:12.904 --> 13:13.424
I felt dirty,

328
13:13.830 --> 13:14.710
so I went to clean up.

329
13:15.824 --> 13:17.105
You should tell us in advance.

330
13:17.745 --> 13:18.664
Leaving so suddenly

331
13:19.184 --> 13:20.064
made us worried.

332
13:21.985 --> 13:23.304
I had plans with friends.

333
13:23.865 --> 13:24.465
It was late.

334
13:24.584 --> 13:26.145
I didn't want to disturb you.

335
13:28.225 --> 13:29.385
Friends?

336
13:30.784 --> 13:31.944
But you said before

337
13:32.544 --> 13:33.664
you didn't have friends.

338
13:33.904 --> 13:34.904
I took your advice

339
13:35.544 --> 13:36.465
and made a few.

340
13:38.745 --> 13:39.184
Honey,

341
13:39.424 --> 13:40.385
let's go to the office.

342
13:41.745 --> 13:42.225
Let's go.

343
13:43.345 --> 13:43.784
Careful.

344
13:55.899 --> 13:57.872
(Article of Dr. Kang Long)

345
14:05.298 --> 14:06.595
(German-Chinese Dictionary, Username, Password)

346
14:07.505 --> 14:07.985
An account

347
14:08.064 --> 14:09.105
of a translation app.

348
14:09.424 --> 14:10.304
I rarely use it,

349
14:10.625 --> 14:11.265
so take it.

350
14:11.745 --> 14:13.184
Here's the account and password.

351
14:14.584 --> 14:15.704
You're the best, Meng.

352
14:16.145 --> 14:17.704
I wish for no overtime tonight.

353
14:19.385 --> 14:21.053
(Article of Dr. Kang Long)

354
14:21.824 --> 14:22.625
Who is this?

355
14:23.184 --> 14:23.865
Dr. Hedgehog.

356
14:25.105 --> 14:25.465
No.

357
14:26.184 --> 14:27.145
Dr. Kang Long.

358
14:28.225 --> 14:29.465
Kang Long?

359
14:31.345 --> 14:32.145
Is it because of

360
14:32.145 --> 14:32.784
his spiky hair?

361
14:33.584 --> 14:34.505
So as his personality.

362
14:35.025 --> 14:35.944
Spiky and cold.

363
14:36.584 --> 14:37.985
He was a visiting scholar

364
14:38.064 --> 14:38.904
in Germany

365
14:39.304 --> 14:40.145
and just returned.

366
14:41.145 --> 14:42.345
Mr. Di flew to Germany

367
14:42.345 --> 14:42.904
to visit him.

368
14:43.424 --> 14:44.385
After multiple attempts,

369
14:44.505 --> 14:46.225
he finally secured the licensing deal.

370
14:47.424 --> 14:48.865
But Ms. Zhang knows

371
14:49.265 --> 14:50.105
Mr. Di's real goal

372
14:50.664 --> 14:52.544
has always been an exclusive deal.

373
14:53.424 --> 14:53.985
So,

374
14:54.505 --> 14:56.145
we've been working hard for it.

375
14:57.184 --> 14:58.304
What does he study?

376
14:58.625 --> 14:59.792
Why do we want him so badly?

377
15:01.184 --> 15:02.345
Hydroxytyrosol.

378
15:03.304 --> 15:05.505
It's an antioxidant

379
15:05.544 --> 15:06.265
ingredient

380
15:06.304 --> 15:07.184
used in cosmetics.

381
15:08.304 --> 15:09.064
He holds a patent

382
15:09.505 --> 15:11.265
that boosts hydroxytyrosol stability

383
15:11.345 --> 15:12.904
to over 90 percent.

384
15:13.505 --> 15:14.544
Many cosmetics companies

385
15:14.544 --> 15:15.584
want to win him over.

386
15:17.145 --> 15:17.904
Besides,

387
15:18.225 --> 15:19.345
our company lacks

388
15:19.345 --> 15:20.945
a top-tier research and development team.

389
15:22.625 --> 15:24.025
If Dr. Kang heads

390
15:24.025 --> 15:25.345
our research and development team

391
15:25.345 --> 15:26.824
and develops

392
15:26.904 --> 15:27.985
exclusive products with us,

393
15:28.345 --> 15:28.784
it'd be

394
15:28.784 --> 15:29.865
massively profitable.

395
15:31.505 --> 15:32.544
He really is a big shot.

396
15:33.105 --> 15:33.664
Can you share

397
15:33.865 --> 15:34.944
his profile with me?

398
15:35.625 --> 15:36.064
Sure.

399
15:48.385 --> 15:49.784
This will be my golden chance

400
15:50.105 --> 15:51.064
to win over Zhang Yu.

401
15:55.865 --> 15:56.865
Feed me a bite.

402
15:58.105 --> 15:58.824
Feed me, Zi.

403
16:02.140 --> 16:03.700
Not worried fried food'll make you fat?

404
16:04.424 --> 16:05.704
I'm starving.

405
16:06.145 --> 16:06.865
At home, I don't

406
16:06.944 --> 16:07.745
eat Lu Hui's dishes,

407
16:07.865 --> 16:08.904
in case she'd poison me.

408
16:09.184 --> 16:10.345
At home,

409
16:11.225 --> 16:12.385
I only eat the same dishes

410
16:12.544 --> 16:13.544
as Di Liren

411
16:13.584 --> 16:14.184
does.

412
16:14.722 --> 16:15.695
Okay, down to business.

413
16:16.184 --> 16:17.424
I already booked tickets

414
16:17.544 --> 16:18.504
to Huacheng tomorrow.

415
16:18.824 --> 16:20.105
How do you know he's there?

416
16:20.584 --> 16:21.584
Silly girl.

417
16:22.625 --> 16:24.105
Huacheng University invited him

418
16:24.184 --> 16:24.824
for a seminar.

419
16:25.105 --> 16:26.145
For top talent

420
16:26.225 --> 16:27.345
like him coming,

421
16:27.824 --> 16:28.424
the news's been

422
16:28.424 --> 16:29.265
on their website.

423
16:29.988 --> 16:31.764
(Kang Long)

424
16:32.145 --> 16:32.664
That's him.

425
16:38.598 --> 16:41.915
(Eight years ago, Jiangzhou)

426
17:01.544 --> 17:02.105
(Sorry.)

427
17:02.345 --> 17:03.304
Guest information

428
17:03.304 --> 17:04.344
is strictly confidential.

429
17:04.384 --> 17:05.344
We can't disclose it.

430
17:06.752 --> 17:09.100
(Seven years ago, Jiangzhou)

431
17:12.665 --> 17:13.144
Zi,

432
17:13.824 --> 17:14.824
without a dad around,

433
17:15.344 --> 17:16.384
you have to name the baby

434
17:16.584 --> 17:17.344
yourself.

435
17:20.025 --> 17:21.584
Let's call her Chestnut.

436
17:23.505 --> 17:24.344
(Chestnut.)

437
17:29.185 --> 17:29.745
What's wrong?

438
17:31.544 --> 17:32.025
Nothing.

439
17:32.384 --> 17:33.104
Go on.

440
17:33.544 --> 17:34.864
Memorized all the company info?

441
17:35.384 --> 17:36.899
Dr. Kang won't stump you, will he?

442
17:38.064 --> 17:39.225
Ask me anything.

443
17:46.025 --> 17:47.505
Switching from a trophy wife

444
17:47.505 --> 17:48.824
to a workaholic so fast

445
17:49.225 --> 17:49.945
is impressive.

446
17:51.784 --> 17:52.384
What?

447
17:52.859 --> 17:53.539
Selling me short?

448
17:54.360 --> 17:55.520
How long did you memorize it?

449
17:56.665 --> 17:57.905
All morning at my desk.

450
17:58.144 --> 17:58.905
Sitting that long

451
17:58.985 --> 17:59.905
might affect your foot.

452
18:00.265 --> 18:01.185
Actually,

453
18:01.384 --> 18:02.544
my leg and foot

454
18:02.745 --> 18:04.225
are pretty much healed.

455
18:04.624 --> 18:06.425
But I want to use it

456
18:06.425 --> 18:07.864
to play a little trick.

457
18:08.104 --> 18:08.905
So,

458
18:09.505 --> 18:10.624
I'll keep up the act.

459
18:14.784 --> 18:15.624
I have a hearing

460
18:15.705 --> 18:16.544
in Huacheng tomorrow.

461
18:16.864 --> 18:17.544
I can

462
18:18.784 --> 18:19.665
give you a ride.

463
18:20.584 --> 18:21.144
Forget it.

464
18:21.544 --> 18:22.705
What if Di Liren

465
18:22.745 --> 18:23.544
finds out?

466
18:24.144 --> 18:25.185
I'd better go alone.

467
18:25.384 --> 18:26.185
The three of you

468
18:26.185 --> 18:27.384
under the same roof,

469
18:28.824 --> 18:29.304
how's it?

470
18:29.705 --> 18:31.465
It's all like a spy versus spy thing.

471
18:31.665 --> 18:32.985
I have to keep provoking them

472
18:33.104 --> 18:33.985
and testing them

473
18:34.064 --> 18:35.384
to find out what's going on,

474
18:35.434 --> 18:36.642
if there's any real feeling.

475
18:36.864 --> 18:37.505
Any results?

476
18:38.104 --> 18:39.425
Di Liren is such an actor.

477
18:39.905 --> 18:40.905
No results yet.

478
18:43.144 --> 18:45.185
But I do feel

479
18:45.584 --> 18:46.905
Lu Hui is acting differently.

480
18:47.384 --> 18:48.864
Lately, she seems

481
18:49.265 --> 18:50.624
much more rattled than before.

482
18:51.705 --> 18:52.745
I need to keep

483
18:52.784 --> 18:53.624
an eye on her.

484
19:03.505 --> 19:05.144
It hurts, honey.

485
19:05.425 --> 19:06.784
I'll be gentle.

486
19:09.665 --> 19:10.304
Be gentle.

487
19:12.384 --> 19:13.344
Seems Meng's leg

488
19:13.344 --> 19:14.384
has mostly healed.

489
19:15.425 --> 19:16.985
Luckily it was just muscle, not bone.

490
19:19.144 --> 19:19.864
But why doesn't it

491
19:19.864 --> 19:21.745
feel healed at all?

492
19:22.505 --> 19:23.465
Listen, Ms. Hui,

493
19:23.784 --> 19:25.025
whenever I walk around,

494
19:25.824 --> 19:27.425
a sharp pain

495
19:27.425 --> 19:28.945
shoots straight

496
19:28.985 --> 19:30.265
through my heart.

497
19:30.544 --> 19:31.624
So painful.

498
19:31.784 --> 19:32.784
Look how I walk.

499
19:32.945 --> 19:33.905
Just like this.

500
19:35.745 --> 19:36.745
I can't walk properly.

501
19:37.705 --> 19:38.824
I have to hop around.

502
19:39.238 --> 19:39.905
Sometimes I...

503
19:39.905 --> 19:40.624
Careful.

504
19:40.624 --> 19:42.185
Come sit down.

505
19:44.185 --> 19:45.945
Then you still need the crutch.

506
19:46.544 --> 19:47.225
Your crutch looks

507
19:47.225 --> 19:48.265
barely used.

508
19:50.384 --> 19:51.064
What do you mean?

509
19:51.265 --> 19:52.104
When I wiped it down,

510
19:52.144 --> 19:53.304
the rubber tip

511
19:53.344 --> 19:54.064
looks brand new.

512
19:54.344 --> 19:55.384
No wear and tear at all.

513
19:56.185 --> 19:57.425
I thought you're healed.

514
20:00.864 --> 20:02.104
The office and company

515
20:02.185 --> 20:03.465
have carpets and wooden floors.

516
20:03.584 --> 20:04.824
So there's no wear and tear.

517
20:04.985 --> 20:05.505
Mostly,

518
20:05.505 --> 20:06.425
I just hop around

519
20:06.624 --> 20:07.344
without it.

520
20:11.064 --> 20:12.144
You still need to use it.

521
20:12.864 --> 20:13.384
Otherwise,

522
20:13.425 --> 20:14.465
it's bad for recovery.

523
20:14.705 --> 20:15.945
No wonder you're still in pain.

524
20:16.864 --> 20:17.304
Forgot it?

525
20:17.705 --> 20:18.665
Ms. Hui was a nurse.

526
20:18.945 --> 20:19.544
She's skilled.

527
20:20.025 --> 20:21.025
Let her take a look.

528
20:21.544 --> 20:22.425
Let me check.

529
20:24.304 --> 20:25.064
Don't touch it.

530
20:25.384 --> 20:26.344
Don't. It hurts!

531
20:26.544 --> 20:27.544
It's fine. Don't worry.

532
20:27.544 --> 20:28.384
I know my body.

533
20:28.705 --> 20:29.144
I have

534
20:29.225 --> 20:30.544
an important thing to do.

535
20:30.984 --> 20:31.304
Ms. Hui,

536
20:31.304 --> 20:32.344
can you brew a pot of tea

537
20:32.384 --> 20:33.265
with that tea set

538
20:33.304 --> 20:34.185
from the cabinet?

539
20:34.185 --> 20:35.304
I need to finish shooting

540
20:35.624 --> 20:37.064
the product photos with Liu Zi

541
20:37.064 --> 20:37.544
soon.

542
20:37.784 --> 20:38.185
Go ahead.

543
20:38.784 --> 20:39.185
Okay.

544
20:41.745 --> 20:43.025
Come on, careful.

545
20:43.225 --> 20:43.705
Easy.

546
20:44.185 --> 20:44.665
Looks good.

547
20:46.705 --> 20:47.185
Nice.

548
20:48.119 --> 20:48.974
Is the lighting okay?

549
20:49.304 --> 20:49.705
Perfect.

550
20:49.745 --> 20:50.945
Honey, fan a little breeze.

551
20:51.384 --> 20:51.945
Got it.

552
20:54.025 --> 20:55.025
That's perfect.

553
20:57.864 --> 20:58.584
Hold on.

554
20:59.985 --> 21:01.144
The hair is a bit messy.

555
21:02.104 --> 21:02.384
Good.

556
21:02.384 --> 21:03.025
Thanks, honey.

557
21:06.225 --> 21:06.705
Good.

558
21:06.784 --> 21:07.425
We're done.

559
21:07.624 --> 21:07.905
Done?

560
21:07.905 --> 21:08.624
Let's end it.

561
21:09.225 --> 21:09.584
Great.

562
21:10.705 --> 21:11.144
Honey,

563
21:11.945 --> 21:12.544
great work.

564
21:13.225 --> 21:14.104
Thank you.

565
21:15.104 --> 21:15.584
Don't move.

566
21:16.705 --> 21:18.025
This moment is so sweet.

567
21:18.104 --> 21:18.985
I have to capture it.

568
21:19.384 --> 21:19.784
Come on.

569
21:21.905 --> 21:22.384
Get closer.

570
21:23.185 --> 21:23.784
Let's take one.

571
21:25.104 --> 21:25.784
Nice.

572
21:29.465 --> 21:30.144
Great.

573
21:30.505 --> 21:30.945
Nice.

574
21:33.265 --> 21:34.265
Come closer to me.

575
21:36.425 --> 21:36.905
Good.

576
21:39.505 --> 21:40.505
You can stand up.

577
21:41.104 --> 21:41.465
Okay.

578
21:41.905 --> 21:42.265
Okay.

579
21:42.505 --> 21:43.225
Over here, honey.

580
21:43.465 --> 21:43.784
Okay.

581
21:45.064 --> 21:45.425
Come on.

582
21:49.144 --> 21:49.705
Nice.

583
21:50.225 --> 21:51.064
A bit closer.

584
21:59.465 --> 21:59.985
Gorgeous.

585
22:00.905 --> 22:02.745
Mr. Di, your pant legs...

586
22:04.144 --> 22:04.665
Ms. Hui,

587
22:04.945 --> 22:05.705
could you please

588
22:05.745 --> 22:07.064
fix his pant legs?

589
22:07.225 --> 22:08.064
Go ahead. No worries.

590
22:08.544 --> 22:09.225
- Okay. - Better fix it.

591
22:09.705 --> 22:11.025
Or the full shot won't look good.

592
22:13.544 --> 22:14.705
You can just edit it later.

593
22:14.705 --> 22:15.985
It's fine. I'll straighten them.

594
22:30.465 --> 22:31.384
Let me check.

595
22:33.665 --> 22:34.185
See?

596
22:34.705 --> 22:36.304
Ms. Hui knows her stuff well.

597
22:36.824 --> 22:37.425
So neat.

598
22:38.104 --> 22:39.104
I'm a housekeeper.

599
22:39.584 --> 22:40.665
This is basic stuff.

600
22:42.384 --> 22:42.864
Well,

601
22:43.225 --> 22:43.945
it's getting late.

602
22:45.025 --> 22:46.064
Let's call it a day.

603
22:46.624 --> 22:47.064
Honey,

604
22:47.465 --> 22:47.985
let's check

605
22:48.064 --> 22:49.074
the photos we took, okay?

606
22:50.185 --> 22:50.544
Come on.

607
22:51.505 --> 22:52.144
Careful.

608
22:54.144 --> 22:55.665
Look, you look great together.

609
22:56.945 --> 22:58.225
I like this one, honey.

610
22:58.695 --> 22:59.295
What about you?

611
23:00.104 --> 23:00.465
Nice.

612
23:02.104 --> 23:02.745
So pretty.

613
23:02.985 --> 23:03.905
I'll print this out

614
23:03.945 --> 23:04.505
today.

615
23:08.384 --> 23:08.945
Meng,

616
23:09.584 --> 23:10.425
the photo is printed.

617
23:10.544 --> 23:11.505
Where do you hang it?

618
23:11.784 --> 23:12.584
It's printed?

619
23:13.144 --> 23:13.705
Let me see.

620
23:18.985 --> 23:20.824
Hang it on...

621
23:26.665 --> 23:27.265
Come in here.

622
23:30.265 --> 23:31.144
How about over there?

623
23:32.665 --> 23:33.225
Honey,

624
23:34.265 --> 23:35.624
this is a photo of us two.

625
23:36.144 --> 23:37.425
Why hang it in Ms. Hui's room?

626
23:37.824 --> 23:38.864
What's wrong with that?

627
23:39.344 --> 23:40.384
It is our house.

628
23:40.505 --> 23:41.425
I can hang it anywhere.

629
23:41.705 --> 23:42.064
Yeah.

630
23:42.225 --> 23:43.544
Ms. Hui is only staying for now.

631
23:43.745 --> 23:44.824
It should be fine, right?

632
23:46.584 --> 23:47.104
Ms. Hui,

633
23:47.945 --> 23:49.025
do you mind if I hang this

634
23:49.624 --> 23:50.225
over there?

635
23:52.864 --> 23:53.225
Sure.

636
23:54.304 --> 23:54.905
Hang it there.

637
23:56.584 --> 23:56.985
Go ahead.

638
23:58.745 --> 23:59.104
Okay.

639
24:04.025 --> 24:04.985
Alright, you go back.

640
24:07.505 --> 24:09.025
After the show we put on today,

641
24:09.425 --> 24:10.344
they're bound

642
24:10.745 --> 24:11.705
to make a move, right?

643
24:12.304 --> 24:13.665
We have to make them

644
24:13.745 --> 24:14.905
slip up soon.

645
24:16.985 --> 24:18.784
Thanks for today, Zi.

646
24:19.985 --> 24:20.905
You put on

647
24:20.945 --> 24:21.665
a great show too.

648
24:22.265 --> 24:23.465
That's why we're besties.

649
24:23.900 --> 24:24.380
Lift's here.

650
24:24.745 --> 24:25.665
See you, bye-bye.

651
25:50.905 --> 25:51.864
Morning, Ms. Hui.

652
25:52.104 --> 25:52.665
Morning.

653
25:53.344 --> 25:53.824
Ms. Hui,

654
25:54.225 --> 25:54.784
I got a place

655
25:54.824 --> 25:55.544
for that photo

656
25:55.665 --> 25:56.465
of me and Liren.

657
25:56.624 --> 25:57.864
Please take it down later.

658
25:58.144 --> 25:59.465
I shouldn't hang it with you.

659
26:00.144 --> 26:01.025
I threw it away.

660
26:01.584 --> 26:02.225
What?

661
26:03.425 --> 26:04.144
Where is it now?

662
26:05.144 --> 26:05.705
In the trash.

663
26:08.304 --> 26:09.304
The frame wasn't secure,

664
26:09.465 --> 26:10.584
and it fell off the wall.

665
26:10.824 --> 26:12.185
The glass shattered. It's ruined.

666
26:13.665 --> 26:14.304
Ms. Hui,

667
26:14.465 --> 26:15.544
I can just buy

668
26:15.544 --> 26:16.505
a new frame.

669
26:16.705 --> 26:18.104
Why did you throw the photo away?

670
26:18.985 --> 26:19.864
The glass scratched

671
26:19.864 --> 26:20.624
the photo.

672
26:20.985 --> 26:21.745
It was ruined.

673
26:23.265 --> 26:23.864
Alright then.

674
26:24.304 --> 26:24.905
I can print

675
26:24.905 --> 26:26.745
another one today anyway.

676
26:28.144 --> 26:29.064
Back in my hometown,

677
26:29.304 --> 26:31.104
a photo falling off the wall

678
26:31.225 --> 26:32.225
is considered bad luck.

679
26:32.824 --> 26:34.144
I think don't hang it for now.

680
26:34.584 --> 26:35.225
For good luck.

681
26:36.185 --> 26:36.864
Really?

682
26:37.544 --> 26:38.705
Ms. Hui, you know so much.

683
26:38.985 --> 26:39.425
Alright.

684
26:39.584 --> 26:40.465
As you say.

685
26:42.185 --> 26:42.624
Well,

686
26:42.824 --> 26:43.784
did my shoes arrive?

687
26:44.624 --> 26:44.985
Yes.

688
26:55.544 --> 26:55.945
Ms. Hui,

689
26:57.544 --> 26:59.144
can you help me try them on?

690
27:00.185 --> 27:00.544
Sure.

691
27:01.304 --> 27:01.665
Here.

692
27:09.384 --> 27:11.430
(Moisturizing and Repair Mechanism)

693
27:20.784 --> 27:21.104
Hello.

694
27:21.883 --> 27:22.403
Let me pass.

695
27:22.665 --> 27:23.064
My seat.

696
27:28.104 --> 27:28.665
